// Git 工具视图：仓库登记 → 仓库工作台（变更 / 分支 / 历史 / Stash + diff）+ 密钥管理 + 克隆。
import { ListView, LineEdit, CheckBox, TabWidget } from "std-widgets.slint";
import { Theme } from "../globals/Theme.slint";
import { GitUI, GitChangeRow, GitCommitRow, GitBranchRow, GitStashRow } from "../globals/GitUI.slint";
import { AppState } from "../globals/AppState.slint";
import { AppButton, AppIconButton, Label, HLine, SectionHeader, StatusPill, Panel, EmptyState } from "../components/Controls.slint";

// 变更分组（冲突 / 未暂存 / 已暂存 / 未推送）
component ChangeSection inherits Rectangle {
    in property <string> title;
    in property <[GitChangeRow]> rows;
    in property <int> section;
    in property <color> tint: Theme.text-secondary;
    callback selected(int, int);

    VerticalLayout {
        spacing: 0;

        Rectangle {
            height: 26px;
            background: Theme.surface;
            HorizontalLayout {
                padding-left: 10px;
                padding-right: 8px;
                spacing: 6px;
                cross-axis-alignment: center;
                SectionHeader { text: root.title; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                Label { text: "\{root.rows.length}"; size: Theme.fs-caption; role: 2; }
            }
        }

        HLine {}

        if root.rows.length == 0: Label {
            text: "（空）";
            size: Theme.fs-caption;
            role: 2;
            vertical-alignment: center;
        }

        if root.rows.length > 0: ListView {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            for r[index] in root.rows: Rectangle {
                height: 26px;
                background: GitUI.selected-list == root.section && GitUI.selected-index == index
                    ? Theme.accent-soft
                    : (row-tap.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent);
                row-tap := TouchArea { clicked => { root.selected(root.section, index); } }
                HorizontalLayout {
                    padding-left: 10px;
                    padding-right: 4px;
                    spacing: 5px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                    Text {
                        text: r.untracked ? "U" : r.status;
                        width: 18px;
                        color: r.untracked ? Theme.warn : Theme.text-tertiary;
                        font-family: "Consolas";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    Label { text: r.path; size: Theme.fs-small; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E710}"; box: 20px; icon-size: 9px; clicked => { GitUI.stage(root.section, index); } }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E738}"; box: 20px; icon-size: 9px; clicked => { GitUI.unstage(root.section, index); } }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E74D}"; box: 20px; icon-size: 9px; clicked => { GitUI.discard(root.section, index); } }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}

export component GitToolView inherits Rectangle {
    background: Theme.content-bg;

    // ===== 未打开仓库：登记列表 =====
    if !GitUI.repo-open: VerticalLayout {
        padding-left: 32px;
        padding-right: 32px;
        padding-top: 32px;
        padding-bottom: 24px;
        spacing: 12px;

        Text {
            text: "Git 仓库";
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: Theme.text;
        }
        Label {
            text: "登记本地仓库后即可查看变更、提交、分支与密钥绑定。";
            role: 1;
            size: Theme.fs-small;
        }

        HorizontalLayout {
            spacing: 8px;
            cross-axis-alignment: center;

            AppButton { label: "登记仓库…"; icon: "\u{E8B7}"; kind: 1; clicked => { GitUI.open-repo-path(); } }
            AppButton { label: "克隆仓库…"; icon: "\u{E896}"; clicked => { GitUI.clone-start(); } }
            AppButton { label: "密钥管理"; icon: "\u{E8D7}"; clicked => { GitUI.keys-open(); } }
            Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
        }

        if AppState.git-missing: Rectangle {
            height: 52px;
            border-radius: Theme.radius;
            background: Theme.warn-soft;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.warn;

            HorizontalLayout {
                padding-left: 12px;
                padding-right: 10px;
                spacing: 10px;
                cross-axis-alignment: center;

                Label {
                    text: "未检测到 Git，Git 工具不可用。可一键安装便携版（下载到数据目录，不修改系统）。";
                    size: Theme.fs-small;
                    color: Theme.warn;
                    horizontal-stretch: 1;
                }
                if !AppState.tools-installing: AppButton { label: "一键安装"; kind: 1; btn-height: 26px; clicked => { AppState.install-tool(0); } }
                if AppState.tools-installing: Label { text: AppState.tools-status; size: Theme.fs-small; role: 1; }
            }
        }

        Rectangle {
            vertical-stretch: 1;
            min-height: 180px;
            border-radius: Theme.radius;
            background: Theme.card-bg;
            border-width: 1px;
            border-color: Theme.border;

            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 0;

                Rectangle {
                    height: 32px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        padding-left: 12px;
                        padding-right: 12px;
                        cross-axis-alignment: center;
                        SectionHeader { text: "已登记仓库"; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                        Label { text: "\{GitUI.repos.length} 个"; size: Theme.fs-caption; role: 2; }
                    }
                }
                HLine {}

                if GitUI.repos.length == 0: EmptyState {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    icon: "\u{E8AB}";
                    title: "还没有登记仓库";
                    hint: "点击「登记仓库…」选择本地目录";
                }

                if GitUI.repos.length > 0: ListView {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    for n[index] in GitUI.repos: Rectangle {
                        height: 36px;
                        background: repo-tap.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
                        repo-tap := TouchArea { clicked => { GitUI.repo-selected(index); } }
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            padding-left: 10px + n.depth * 16px;
                            padding-right: 8px;
                            spacing: 8px;
                            cross-axis-alignment: center;
                            Text {
                                width: 18px;
                                text: n.is-folder ? "\u{E8B7}" : "\u{E8AB}";
                                font-family: "Segoe MDL2 Assets";
                                font-size: Theme.fs-small;
                                color: n.is-folder ? Theme.text-secondary : Theme.accent;
                                horizontal-alignment: center;
                                vertical-alignment: center;
                            }
                            Label { text: n.name; size: Theme.fs-small; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                            AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E74D}"; box: 24px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.repo-deleted(index); } }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ===== 已打开仓库：工作台 =====
    if GitUI.repo-open: VerticalLayout {
        spacing: 0;

        // 仓库头部
        Rectangle {
            height: 56px;
            background: Theme.surface;

            VerticalLayout {
                spacing: 0;

                HorizontalLayout {
                    height: 32px;
                    padding-left: Theme.pad;
                    padding-right: 8px;
                    spacing: 8px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;

                    Text {
                        text: GitUI.banner-branch;
                        color: Theme.text;
                        font-family: "Consolas";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-small;
                        font-weight: 700;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    Text {
                        text: "↑\{GitUI.ahead} ↓\{GitUI.behind}";
                        color: Theme.text-secondary;
                        font-family: "Consolas";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                        vertical-alignment: center;
                    }
                    if GitUI.conflict-count > 0: StatusPill {
                        label: "冲突 \{GitUI.conflict-count}";
                        tint: Theme.warn;
                        soft: Theme.warn-soft;
                    }
                    if GitUI.rebasing: StatusPill {
                        label: "变基中";
                        tint: Theme.warn;
                        soft: Theme.warn-soft;
                    }

                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }

                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E72C}"; box: 26px; icon-size: 11px; clicked => { GitUI.refresh-all(); } }
                    AppButton { label: "获取"; btn-height: 26px; enabled: !GitUI.busy; clicked => { GitUI.fetch(); } }
                    AppButton { label: "拉取"; btn-height: 26px; enabled: !GitUI.busy; clicked => { GitUI.pull(); } }
                    AppButton { label: "推送"; btn-height: 26px; enabled: !GitUI.busy; clicked => { GitUI.push(); } }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E8AB}"; box: 26px; icon-size: 11px; clicked => { GitUI.keys-open(); } }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E711}"; box: 26px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.close-repo(); } }
                }

                Rectangle {
                    height: 24px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        padding-left: Theme.pad;
                        padding-right: Theme.pad;
                        spacing: 8px;
                        cross-axis-alignment: center;
                        Text {
                            text: "远程";
                            color: Theme.text-tertiary;
                            font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                            vertical-alignment: center;
                        }
                        LineEdit {
                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                            height: 22px;
                            text: GitUI.remote-url;
                            placeholder-text: "（未配置远程）";
                            font-family: "Consolas";
                            font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                            accepted(t) => { GitUI.edit-remote-url(t); }
                        }
                        Label {
                            text: GitUI.bound-key-name == "" ? "未绑定密钥" : "密钥 · \{GitUI.bound-key-name}";
                            size: Theme.fs-caption;
                            role: 2;
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }

        HLine {}

        // 分区
        TabWidget {
            vertical-stretch: 1;

            // ---- 变更 ----
            Tab {
                title: "变更";
                VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 0;

                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 0;
                        vertical-stretch: 1;

                    // 变更列表
                    Rectangle {
                        width: 320px;

                        VerticalLayout {
                            spacing: 0;

                            ChangeSection {
                                title: "冲突";
                                rows: GitUI.changes-conflict;
                                section: 0;
                                vertical-stretch: 1;
                                selected(i1, i2) => { GitUI.select-change(i1, i2); }
                            }
                            HLine {}
                            ChangeSection {
                                title: "未暂存";
                                rows: GitUI.changes-unstaged;
                                section: 1;
                                vertical-stretch: 1;
                                selected(i1, i2) => { GitUI.select-change(i1, i2); }
                            }
                            HLine {}
                            ChangeSection {
                                title: "已暂存";
                                rows: GitUI.changes-staged;
                                section: 2;
                                vertical-stretch: 1;
                                selected(i1, i2) => { GitUI.select-change(i1, i2); }
                            }

                        }
                    }

                    Rectangle { width: 1px; background: Theme.divider; }

                    // diff
                    Rectangle {
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;

                        VerticalLayout {
                            spacing: 0;

                            Rectangle {
                                height: 34px;
                                HorizontalLayout {
                                    padding-left: Theme.pad;
                                    padding-right: 8px;
                                    spacing: 6px;
                                    cross-axis-alignment: center;

                                    Label {
                                        text: GitUI.diff-path == "" ? "选择左侧文件查看差异" : GitUI.diff-path;
                                        size: Theme.fs-small;
                                        role: 1;
                                        mono: true;
                                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                                    }

                                    if GitUI.diff-path != "" && GitUI.conflict-count > 0: HorizontalLayout {
                                        spacing: 4px;
                                        AppButton { label: "保留我方"; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.conflict-ours(GitUI.selected-index); } }
                                        AppButton { label: "保留对方"; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.conflict-theirs(GitUI.selected-index); } }
                                        AppButton { label: "已解决"; kind: 1; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.conflict-resolved(GitUI.selected-index); } }
                                    }
                                    if GitUI.rebasing: AppButton { label: "中止变基"; kind: 2; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.rebase-abort(); } }
                                }
                            }

                            HLine {}

                            if GitUI.diff.length == 0: EmptyState {
                                vertical-stretch: 1;
                                icon: "\u{E943}";
                                title: "没有可显示的差异";
                                hint: "在左侧选择一个文件查看差异。";
                            }

                            if GitUI.diff.length > 0: ListView {
                                vertical-stretch: 1;

                                for d in GitUI.diff: Rectangle {
                                    height: 19px;
                                    background: d.kind == 1 ? Theme.ok-soft : (d.kind == 2 ? Theme.danger-soft : (d.kind == 3 ? Theme.warn-soft : transparent));

                                    HorizontalLayout {
                                        Text {
                                            text: d.left-no > 0 ? "\{d.left-no}" : "";
                                            width: 44px; color: Theme.text-tertiary;
                                            font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                                            horizontal-alignment: right; vertical-alignment: center;
                                        }
                                        Text {
                                            text: d.right-no > 0 ? "\{d.right-no}" : "";
                                            width: 44px; color: Theme.text-tertiary;
                                            font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                                            horizontal-alignment: right; vertical-alignment: center;
                                        }
                                        Text {
                                            text: d.text;
                                            color: d.kind == 1 ? Theme.ok : (d.kind == 2 ? Theme.danger : (d.kind == 3 ? Theme.warn : (d.kind == 4 ? Theme.text-secondary : Theme.text)));
                                            font-family: "Consolas";
                                            font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                                            vertical-alignment: center;
                                            overflow: elide;
                                            horizontal-stretch: 1;
                                        }
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    }

                    // 提交栏（固定在分区底部）
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 0;

                        Rectangle {
                            width: 320px;
                            height: 96px;
                            background: Theme.surface;

                            VerticalLayout {
                                padding-left: 10px;
                                padding-right: 10px;
                                padding-top: 8px;
                                padding-bottom: 8px;
                                spacing: 6px;

                                LineEdit {
                                    height: 26px;
                                    placeholder-text: "提交信息…";
                                    text <=> GitUI.commit-message;
                                    font-size: Theme.fs-small;
                                }

                                HorizontalLayout {
                                    spacing: 5px;
                                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                                    CheckBox { text: "Amend"; checked <=> GitUI.amend; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; }

                                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }

                                    AppButton { label: "全存"; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.stage-all(1); } }
                                    AppButton { label: "全消"; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.unstage-all(2); } }
                                    AppButton { label: "提交"; kind: 1; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.commit(); } }
                                }
                            }
                        }

                        Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                    }
                }
            }

            // ---- 分支 ----
            Tab {
                title: "分支";
                VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 0;

                    Rectangle {
                        height: 38px;
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            padding-left: Theme.pad;
                            padding-right: Theme.pad;
                            spacing: 8px;
                            cross-axis-alignment: center;
                            LineEdit {
                                horizontal-stretch: 1;
                                height: 28px;
                                placeholder-text: "新分支名";
                                text <=> GitUI.new-branch-name;
                                font-size: Theme.fs-small;
                            }
                            AppButton { label: "新建分支"; kind: 1; btn-height: 28px; clicked => { GitUI.branch-new(); } }
                        }
                    }
                    HLine {}

                    if GitUI.branches.length == 0: EmptyState {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        icon: "\u{E8AB}";
                        title: "没有分支";
                    }

                    if GitUI.branches.length > 0: ListView {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        for b[index] in GitUI.branches: Rectangle {
                            height: 30px;
                            background: branch-tap.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
                            branch-tap := TouchArea { clicked => { GitUI.branch-switch(index); } }
                            HorizontalLayout {
                                padding-left: Theme.pad;
                                padding-right: Theme.pad;
                                spacing: 6px;
                                cross-axis-alignment: center;
                                Text {
                                    text: b.current ? "●" : (b.remote ? "⇄" : "○");
                                    width: 14px;
                                    color: b.current ? Theme.accent : Theme.text-tertiary;
                                    font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                                    vertical-alignment: center;
                                }
                                Label { text: b.name; size: Theme.fs-small; mono: true; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                if !b.remote && !b.current: AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E8AB}"; box: 22px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.merge-branch(index); } }
                                if !b.remote && !b.current: AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E74D}"; box: 22px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.branch-delete(index, false); } }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }

            // ---- 历史 ----
            Tab {
                title: "历史";
                VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 0;

                    Rectangle {
                        height: 38px;
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            padding-left: Theme.pad;
                            padding-right: Theme.pad;
                            spacing: 8px;
                            cross-axis-alignment: center;
                            SectionHeader { text: "提交历史"; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                            AppButton {
                                label: "加载更多";
                                btn-height: 26px;
                                enabled: GitUI.has-more-history;
                                clicked => { GitUI.history-more(); }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                    HLine {}

                    if GitUI.history.length == 0: EmptyState {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        icon: "\u{E8AB}";
                        title: "没有提交记录";
                    }

                    if GitUI.history.length > 0: ListView {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        for c[index] in GitUI.history: Rectangle {
                            height: 30px;
                            background: commit-tap.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
                            commit-tap := TouchArea { clicked => { GitUI.history-menu(index, 4); } }
                            HorizontalLayout {
                                padding-left: Theme.pad;
                                padding-right: Theme.pad;
                                spacing: 8px;
                                cross-axis-alignment: center;
                                Text { text: c.short; width: 56px; color: Theme.accent; font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                Label { text: c.subject; size: Theme.fs-small; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                Text { text: c.author; color: Theme.text-tertiary; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; width: 110px; vertical-alignment: center; overflow: elide; }
                                Text { text: c.date; color: Theme.text-tertiary; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; width: 130px; vertical-alignment: center; overflow: elide; }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }

            // ---- Stash ----
            Tab {
                title: "Stash";
                VerticalLayout {
                    spacing: 0;

                    Rectangle {
                        height: 38px;
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            padding-left: Theme.pad;
                            padding-right: Theme.pad;
                            spacing: 8px;
                            cross-axis-alignment: center;
                            SectionHeader { text: "Stash"; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                            AppButton { label: "暂存当前改动"; btn-height: 26px; clicked => { GitUI.stash-push(); } }
                        }
                    }
                    HLine {}

                    if GitUI.stashes.length == 0: EmptyState {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        icon: "\u{E74F}";
                        title: "没有 stash 记录";
                    }

                    if GitUI.stashes.length > 0: ListView {
                        vertical-stretch: 1;
                        for s[index] in GitUI.stashes: Rectangle {
                            height: 30px;
                            background: stash-tap.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
                            stash-tap := TouchArea { clicked => { GitUI.stash-pop(index); } }
                            HorizontalLayout {
                                padding-left: Theme.pad;
                                padding-right: Theme.pad;
                                spacing: 6px;
                                cross-axis-alignment: center;
                                Text { text: "stash@\{s.index}"; color: Theme.text-secondary; font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; vertical-alignment: center; }
                                Label { text: s.message; size: Theme.fs-small; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                                AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E74D}"; box: 22px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.stash-drop(index); } }
                            }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ===== 密钥管理浮层 =====
    if GitUI.keys-visible: Rectangle {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);

        Panel {
            width: min(root.width - 48px, 660px);
            height: min(root.height - 48px, 440px);
            x: (root.width - self.width) / 2;
            y: (root.height - self.height) / 2;

            VerticalLayout {
                padding: 16px;
                spacing: 10px;

                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 8px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                    Text {
                        text: "SSH 密钥";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-title;
                        font-weight: 600;
                        color: Theme.text;
                        horizontal-stretch: 1;
                    }
                    AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E711}"; box: 24px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.keys-close(); } }
                }

                Label {
                    text: "公钥复制到 GitHub / GitLab；私钥保存在应用数据目录。把数据目录放到同步盘即可跨设备复用同一对密钥。";
                    role: 2;
                    size: Theme.fs-caption;
                    wrap: word-wrap;
                }

                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 6px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                    AppButton { label: "生成密钥"; icon: "\u{E710}"; kind: 1; btn-height: 26px; clicked => { GitUI.key-generate(); } }
                    AppButton { label: "导入私钥"; btn-height: 26px; clicked => { GitUI.key-import(); } }
                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                }

                HLine {}

                if GitUI.keys.length == 0: EmptyState {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    icon: "\u{E8D7}";
                    title: "还没有密钥";
                    hint: "点击「生成密钥」创建一对 Ed25519 密钥。";
                }

                if GitUI.keys.length > 0: ListView {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    for k[index] in GitUI.keys: Rectangle {
                        height: 36px;
                        background: key-ta.has-hover ? Theme.hover : transparent;
                        key-ta := TouchArea {}
                        HorizontalLayout {
                            padding-left: 6px;
                            padding-right: 6px;
                            spacing: 8px;
                            cross-axis-alignment: center;
                            Text { text: k.name; color: Theme.text; font-size: Theme.fs-small; width: 140px; vertical-alignment: center; overflow: elide; }
                            Text { text: k.algorithm; color: Theme.text-tertiary; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; width: 70px; vertical-alignment: center; }
                            Text { text: k.fingerprint; color: Theme.text-tertiary; font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-caption; overflow: elide; vertical-alignment: center; horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                            AppButton { label: "复制公钥"; btn-height: 24px; clicked => { GitUI.key-copy-public(index); } }
                            AppButton {
                                label: k.bound ? "已绑定" : "绑定";
                                kind: k.bound ? 3 : 0;
                                btn-height: 24px;
                                clicked => {
                                    if (k.bound) { GitUI.unbind-key(); } else { GitUI.bind-key(index); }
                                }
                            }
                            AppIconButton { icon: "\u{E74D}"; box: 22px; icon-size: 10px; clicked => { GitUI.key-delete(index); } }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ===== 克隆对话框 =====
    if GitUI.clone-visible: Rectangle {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);

        Panel {
            width: min(root.width - 48px, 520px);
            height: min(root.height - 48px, 320px);
            x: (root.width - self.width) / 2;
            y: (root.height - self.height) / 2;

            VerticalLayout {
                padding: 18px;
                spacing: 10px;

                Text {
                    text: "克隆仓库";
                    font-size: Theme.fs-title;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: Theme.text;
                }

                Rectangle {
                    height: 30px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 8px;
                        cross-axis-alignment: center;
                        Text { text: "仓库 URL"; width: 88px; color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: Theme.fs-small; vertical-alignment: center; }
                        LineEdit { horizontal-stretch: 1; height: 28px; text <=> GitUI.clone-url; placeholder-text: "git@github.com:owner/repo.git"; font-family: "Consolas"; font-size: Theme.fs-small; }
                    }
                }

                Rectangle {
                    height: 30px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 8px;
                        cross-axis-alignment: center;
                        Text { text: "目标目录"; width: 88px; color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: Theme.fs-small; vertical-alignment: center; }
                        LineEdit { horizontal-stretch: 1; height: 28px; text <=> GitUI.clone-parent; font-size: Theme.fs-small; }
                        AppButton { label: "选择…"; btn-height: 26px; clicked => { GitUI.clone-browse(); } }
                    }
                }

                Rectangle {
                    height: 30px;
                    HorizontalLayout {
                        spacing: 8px;
                        cross-axis-alignment: center;
                        Text { text: "别名"; width: 88px; color: Theme.text-secondary; font-size: Theme.fs-small; vertical-alignment: center; }
                        LineEdit { horizontal-stretch: 1; height: 28px; text <=> GitUI.clone-alias; placeholder-text: "留空取仓库名"; font-size: Theme.fs-small; }
                    }
                }

                if GitUI.console-text != "": Rectangle {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    min-height: 80px;
                    border-radius: Theme.radius;
                    background: Theme.surface;
                    border-width: 1px;
                    border-color: Theme.border;
                    Text {
                        x: 8px;
                        y: 6px;
                        width: parent.width - 16px;
                        height: parent.height - 12px;
                        text: GitUI.console-text;
                        color: Theme.text-secondary;
                        font-family: "Consolas";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
                        wrap: word-wrap;
                    }
                }

                Rectangle { vertical-stretch: 1; }

                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 8px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                    AppButton { label: "取消"; clicked => { GitUI.clone-cancel(); } }
                    AppButton { label: "克隆"; kind: 1; enabled: !GitUI.busy; clicked => { GitUI.clone-confirm(); } }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ===== 输出控制台 =====
    if GitUI.console-visible: Rectangle {
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);

        Panel {
            width: min(root.width - 48px, 620px);
            height: min(root.height - 48px, 400px);
            x: (root.width - self.width) / 2;
            y: (root.height - self.height) / 2;

            VerticalLayout {
                padding: 16px;
                spacing: 10px;

                Text {
                    text: "Git 输出";
                    font-size: Theme.fs-title;
                    font-weight: 600;
                    color: Theme.text;
                }

                Rectangle {
                    vertical-stretch: 1;
                    border-radius: Theme.radius;
                    background: Theme.surface;
                    border-width: 1px;
                    border-color: Theme.border;

                    Text {
                        x: 10px;
                        y: 8px;
                        width: parent.width - 20px;
                        height: parent.height - 16px;
                        text: GitUI.console-text;
                        color: Theme.text;
                        font-family: "Consolas";
                        font-size: Theme.fs-small;
                        wrap: word-wrap;
                    }
                }

                HorizontalLayout {
                    spacing: 8px;
                    cross-axis-alignment: center;
                    Rectangle { horizontal-stretch: 1; }
                    AppButton { label: "关闭"; clicked => { GitUI.console-close(); } }
                }
            }
        }
    }

    // ===== toast =====
    if GitUI.toast != "": Rectangle {
        x: max(0px, (parent.width - 320px) / 2);
        y: 14px;
        width: 320px;
        height: 32px;
        border-radius: Theme.radius;
        background: GitUI.toast-kind == 0 ? Theme.ok : Theme.warn;

        Text {
            text: GitUI.toast;
            color: #ffffff;
            font-size: Theme.fs-caption;
            horizontal-alignment: center;
            vertical-alignment: center;
            overflow: elide;
            wrap: no-wrap;
        }
    }
}
